      "content": "I recommend focusing the funding on Zip 90210, 90502, and 90771. Zip 90210 is a good choice to maintain high standards, while 90502 and 90771 represent areas with significant needs, particularly in the minority communities. Investing in these areas will allow the city to address the most pressing social issues, which is where the community center will have the most visible impact.",
